From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:01:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Plank sack: fill, check, empty and planks used from the sack

Up to 28 planks of the seven types in the plank_sack_* varbits RuneLite's Plank Sack plugin reads.
Fill (or a plank used on the sack), Check ('Oak planks: 3' per type, 'Your sack is currently
empty.'), Empty into the inventory. A PlayerItemStorageHook lets content use planks straight from
the sack while it is in the inventory (inventory first). Fill/full/no-space messages are best
guesses; the sawmill does not fill the sack yet. Integration tests.
